"commit hashes (abbreviated to the same length as the old reference).  Use"
" this flag to turn off updating commit hashes in commit messages."
msgstr ""

#: new-start-29051/venv/lib/python3.11/site-packages/git_filter_repo.py:1869
#: venv/lib/python3.11/site-packages/git_filter_repo.py:1869
