"format) when rewriting author, committer, and tagger names and emails.  "
"If the specified file is part of git history, historical versions of the "
"file will be ignored; only the current contents are consulted."
msgstr ""

#: new-start-29051/venv/lib/python3.11/site-packages/git_filter_repo.py:1885
#: venv/lib/python3.11/site-packages/git_filter_repo.py:1885
